  "_comment": [
    "The spreg engine manifest shipped inside GeoDa (Contents/Resources/spreg_engine/ on",
    "macOS, next to GeoDa.exe on Windows, /usr/share/geoda on Linux). It tells the app what",
    "to download for each platform, how big it is and what its sha256 is. Nothing here is",
    "fetched at runtime except the artifact itself.",
    "",
    "solver/ and tools/ are NOT part of the artifact: the solver script travels inside the",
    "application bundle, so fixing the protocol or the report never requires a re-download.",
    "The artifact contains third-party Python only (see PROTOCOL.md and the README).",
    "",
    "Each entry is produced by tools/build_engine.py --manifest-entry; entries still marked",
    "pending have not been built for this release yet and GeoDa should fall back to the",
    "built-in engine on those platforms."
